# ClaudeWorkspace

## Configuration

**User-specific** (managed by `/workspace-init`):

| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Workspace path | `{{WORKSPACE_PATH}}` |
| User Account ID | `{{USER_ACCOUNT_ID}}` |
| User Name | `{{USER_DISPLAY_NAME}}` |

**Org-wide** (PCI defaults; edit if PCI ever changes them):

| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Jira CloudId | `19ff5866-fc24-4369-81c2-4b8de43058a3` |
| Jira site | `https://preferredcredit.atlassian.net` |
| On-prem VPN host | `tfs.preferredcredit.net` |
| Primary projects | `CRD`, `CO`, `CHANGE` |
| Discovery JQL | `project in (CRD, CO) AND status != Complete AND assignee = currentUser()` |

The `On-prem VPN host` is a DNS-resolvable host behind PCI's VPN. Skills probe it during Phase 0 to confirm VPN is up (Atlassian Cloud alone is public-internet and answers regardless of VPN state).

In this document, `<workspace>` refers to the Workspace path above.

